      "is": "IS 2691:1988",
      "clause": "2",
      "title": "General Quality",
      "text": "2. General Quality — shall be of uniform colour, free from cracks, flaws and nodules of free lime and of even texture. Shall have plane rectangular faces with parallel sides and sharp straight right angled edges.",
